#: pwmanager/masterkey/newmasterkeywnd.cpp:199
msgid ""
"Do not use a Master Key to protect the Database.\n"
"\n"
"Security Note:\n"
"Obviously, if you don't use a Master Key, the data stored in the Database will "
"not be protected against unauthorized access. The data will only be obfuscated, "
"but not encrypted in a secure manner.\n"
"\n"
"Press the Ok button now, if you do not want a secure database."
